                            <comment id="15726198" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 6 Dec 2016 17:48:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It looks like, it was broken in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2680&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2680&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15726493" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 6 Dec 2016 19:44:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ascherbakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ascherbakov&quot;&gt;ascherbakov&lt;/a&gt;, would you please explain if it is really need to move query execution to GridQueryFieldsResultAdapter.iterator() method?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15728376" author="ascherbakov" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 10:18:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is required for deferred query execution.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Andrew, please move context management inside GridQueryFieldsResultAdapter.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
